					"nextDialogs": [
						730492502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧列格"
				},
				{
					"id": 730492502,
					"content": "明明只要順利進行實驗，我就能夠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730492503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧列格"
				},
				{
					"id": 730492503,
					"content": "別想了，那是不可能的，凱西姆的那個什麼桑什麼機，根本就沒辦法提取死域的能量…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730492504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730492504,
					"content": "也就是說，他從頭到尾都是在騙你啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730492505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730492505,
					"content": "怎麼會這樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730492506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧列格"
				},
				{
					"id": 730492506,
					"content": "就在三十人團那好好悔過，這輩子都別來須彌啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730492507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730492507,
					"content": "通知了三十人團的掌旗官魯克沙。\\n魯克沙的手下將愚人眾收押走了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
